//! stdlib/genomics/mod.sio - SOTA++ Mathematical Genomics Module
//!
//! Revolutionizing genomics through mathematical structures:
//! - DNA as GF(4) field elements with dihedral D_n symmetries
//! - Proteins as quaternion-based S³ manifold structures
//! - Gene regulation as octonionic 8D non-associative dynamics
//! - Variants as epistemic types Knowledge<GF4> with full uncertainty
//! - Gene symbols validated at compile-time against GO/SO ontologies
//!
//! This represents a paradigm shift from "bioinformatics in a new language"
//! to "algebraic biology" where mathematical structures are native
//! biological representations.

